{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_0.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience ancient China in a visually stunning, realistic side-scrolling 3D action-adventure. Play as a master swordswoman, a deadly assassin fighting for justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_2.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling stealth and combat. Infiltrate heavily guarded palaces to eliminate key targets, using stealth or brute force to overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_5.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in dynamic sword fights, showcasing your mastery of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_3.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse environments, from misty mountain forests to tranquil temples, each filled with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Varied Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_14.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through vast deserts, barren landscapes, and treacherous canyons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_7.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore intricate indoor levels with fluid parkour mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_6.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_9.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate deadly traps and hidden passages, requiring both skill and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Breathtaking\u00a0</strong>BOSS battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_11.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_10.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_12.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_1.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_4.gif?t=1744954155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109840/extras/Launch_Trailer_8.gif?t=1744954155\" 